## PROGRESSIVE DOCUMENT UPDATES

Each phase updates the document using `search_replace`:

| Phase | Replace This | With This |
|-------|--------------|-----------|
| 2 | (Add requirements section after Executive Summary) | Actual requirements |
| 3 Pass 1 | `_Pending Phase 3 analysis..._` | Actual findings tables (tagged Pass 1) |
| 3 Pass 2+ | (Append to findings sections) | New findings (tagged Pass N) |
| 4 Pass 1 | `_Pending Phase 4 analysis..._` | Actual mapping verification (tagged Pass 1) |
| 4 Pass 2+ | (Append to mappings section) | New mapping findings (tagged Pass N) |
| 5 | `_Pending RGV completion..._` | RGV Convergence Summary |
| 5 | `_Pending Phase 5 calculation..._` | Actual score breakdown |
| 5 | `_Pending Phase 5..._` | Actual production decision |
| 5 | `_Pending_` | Actual values in Executive Summary |

---

## TEMPLATE STRUCTURE (review-style.yaml)

```yaml
# Key fields to use:
report_type: "summary" | "standard" | "detailed"

sections:
  category_breakdown: true/false
  code_analysis: true/false
  field_mapping_verification: true/false
  best_practices_checklist: true/false
  security_audit: true/false

scoring:
  production_threshold: 80
```

---

## TEMPLATE-DRIVEN RULES

### Report Type Controls Length

| Type | Length | Include |
|------|--------|---------|
| `summary` | 1-2 pages | Score + Critical Issues ONLY |
| `standard` | 2-3 pages | + All severities + Mappings |
| `detailed` | 3-5 pages | + Full breakdown |

### Sections Configuration

- **Generate ONLY sections where `include: true`**
- **NEVER generate sections where `include: false`**

